WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:07.960
The designer of Saddam Hussein's bunker was
the grandson of the woman who built Adolf

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:16.920
Hitler's bunker.

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:23.550
The human brain takes in 11 million bits of
information every second, but is only aware

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:25.590
of 40 of them.

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:28.790
98% of British homes have carpeted floors.

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:32.400
But in Italy, only 2% do.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:37.930
All of the words written on Twitter every
day would fill a 10-million-page book.

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:43.750
A burning candle creates 1.5 million tiny
diamonds per second.

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:50.750
People earning over £14,000 a year are amongst
the richest 4% on the planet.

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:54.350
The ancient Greeks had no word for religion.

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:57.280
Italy's biggest business is the Mafia.

00:00:57.280 --> 00:01:04.489
It turns over $178 billion a year and accounts
for 7% of the country's GDP.

00:01:04.489 --> 00:01:10.890
Kangaroos, koalas, wombats and Tasmanian devils
all have three vaginas.

00:01:10.890 --> 00:01:17.499
In the 17th century, the salary of the Governor
of Barbados was paid in sugar.

00:01:17.499 --> 00:01:27.840
Worldwide sales of cocaine earn more than
Microsoft, McDonald's and Kellogg's combined.

